      <h1>Major Milestones in Bitcoin History</h1>
      <p class="msc-learn-page__deck">Bitcoin history includes protocol events, software releases, network activations, business failures, legal decisions, cultural moments, and adoption claims. These events can influence one another, but they are not interchangeable.

This guide selects milestones that changed what Bitcoin could do, how people coordinated around it, or how institutions treated it. It does not rank them by price impact, and it keeps documented facts separate from later interpretation.</p>
